This project dynamically uses psycopg and psycopg-binary (LGPL-3.0-only).
The packages are separately installed from PyPI; their license and source are
available at https://www.psycopg.org/ and in their distributions.

The frontend uses Inter via @fontsource-variable/inter, distributed under
SIL Open Font License 1.1. Its OFL text is in the npm package distribution.
No JetBrains Mono font files or Exowatt brand assets are included.

Optional TypeSafe Jev and OpenAI integrations make HTTP requests to their
providers; no third-party proprietary SDK or model weights are bundled.
